  the embedded root carries: 0,0,0,9
-- where nothing can be padded --
  padding_left on a <Label> is refused: true
  and the message says why: true
  padding_x on a <Label> is refused: true
  and the message says why: true
  padding_top on a <ScrollView> is refused: true
  and the message says why: true
  but margin_top on a <Label> is its own to set: 3,0,0,0
